      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Video → blog post\nUpload a video/podcast in the form. S.A Labs transcribes it (20 credits/min), then the AI writes a blog post.\n\n## Setup (2 minutes)\n1. Install the **S.A Labs** node: Settings → Community nodes → `n8n-nodes-salabs`.\n2. Open each **S.A Labs** node → Credential → *Create new* → paste your API key from the S.A Labs dashboard.\n3. The AI step uses **Google Gemini** (free API key from aistudio.google.com). You can swap it for OpenAI, Claude or any other chat model.\n4. Click **Test workflow**, upload a file, wait for the post.",
